-# The label beside the mailing-list opt-in checkbox on public order pages.
-# Renders inline (no wrapper): callers put it inside their own paragraph, or
-# `capture` it to hand a form builder a label.
-#
-# `other_theater:` (optional) is a second house whose list the same checkbox
-# subscribes the patron to -- a visiting company renting the stage, or the
-# company a FlexPass is good at. Nil, or omitted, means the house alone.
-#
-# The sentence under it is a fact (theater: mailing_list_blurb:), because what
-# a house promises to send is a promise it wants to word itself.
- other_theater = local_assigns[:other_theater]
- if other_theater
  = "Join the #{theater_info.name} and #{other_theater.name} mailing lists."
- else
  = "Join the #{theater_info.name} mailing list."
- if theater_info.mailing_list_blurb.present?
  %br/
  %span{:style => "font-size: 80%"}= theater_info.mailing_list_blurb
